OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife charity seeks funds for
OL,4,Abigger home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife rescue charity has appealed
OL,7,Ffor donations to help it move to a
OL,8,Fbigger home.
OL,10,FLaxey House Wildlife Rescue in
OL,11,FScunthorpe, North Lincolnshire, was
OL,12,Ffounded in 2022 and rehabilitates
OL,13,Finjured native wildlife to release back
OL,14,Finto the wild.
OL,16,FChair and founder Tara Gough said the
OL,17,Fcharity had outgrown its current
OL,18,Fpremises, having taken in almost 1,000
OL,19,Fanimals this year so far, compared to
OL,20,F530 during the whole of 2024.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
